Note that the given <code>Map</code> may be pre-populated with beans;
or new, still allowing for beans to be registered via <a href="#addBean(java.lang.String,java.lang.Object)"><code>addBean(String, Object)</code></a>;
or <a class="external-link" href="https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/Collections.html#emptyMap()" title="class or interface in java.util"><code>Collections.emptyMap()</code></a> for a dummy factory which
enforces operating against an empty set of beans.
